<h1>New Visa Letter Application</h1>

<p>A new visa letter application has been submitted and is pending review.</p>

<h2>Application Details</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Reference Number:</strong> <%= @application.reference_number %></li>
  <li><strong>Event:</strong> <%= @event.name %></li>
  <li><strong>Submitted:</strong> <%= @application.submitted_at&.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></li>
</ul>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;"><%= mail_button "Review Application", @review_url %></p>

<p>The applicant's details are in Attend, not in this email.</p>
